%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:62 (writeCsv-quoteHeader-test)
testing: quoteHeader forces header fields to be quoted
元の形: io/writeCsv の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write([{"name": "Alice", "age": 30}], "application/csv", {"quoteHeader": true})
%%% output application/json
"\"name\",\"age\"\nAlice,30\n"
